<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>Coordinator on Beyond Swift</title><link>https://beyondswift.com/tags/coordinator/</link><description>Recent content in Coordinator on Beyond Swift</description><generator>Hugo -- 0.163.3</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 23:38:00 +0530</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://beyondswift.com/tags/coordinator/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>The coordinator pattern's quiet memory leak</title><link>https://beyondswift.com/coordinator-pattern-for-navigation/</link><pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 23:38:00 +0530</pubDate><guid>https://beyondswift.com/coordinator-pattern-for-navigation/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Here is the coordinator every UIKit app grows into. A parent holds its children in an array and starts a new one whenever it pushes a flow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-swift" data-lang="swift"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;protocol&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Coordinator&lt;/span&gt;: AnyObject {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;var&lt;/span&gt; childCoordinators: [Coordinator] { &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;get&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;set&lt;/span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;start&lt;/span&gt;()
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;final&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;AppCoordinator&lt;/span&gt;: Coordinator {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;var&lt;/span&gt; childCoordinators: [Coordinator] = []
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;let&lt;/span&gt; nav: UINavigationController
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;init&lt;/span&gt;(nav: UINavigationController) { &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;.nav = nav }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;showProfile&lt;/span&gt;() {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;let&lt;/span&gt; child = ProfileCoordinator(nav: nav)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; childCoordinators.append(child) &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// retained here&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; child.start() &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// pushes ProfileViewController&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;A user opens a profile, taps back, opens another, taps back, and does it ten more times. Question before you scroll: how many &lt;code&gt;ProfileCoordinator&lt;/code&gt; instances are alive now?&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>